WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.260
The storeroom floor is done.

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:05.174
Every tile is in its place.

00:00:05.224 --> 00:00:10.701
So, if you know the area and one side, how can you find the other side?

00:00:10.751 --> 00:00:15.774
Ask: the side I know, times what, makes the area?

00:00:15.824 --> 00:00:18.224
Put both in the same units first.

00:00:18.274 --> 00:00:20.662
Divide the area by that side.

00:00:20.712 --> 00:00:24.354
Then multiply to check that you get the area back.

00:00:24.404 --> 00:00:29.602
Next time, the Duke wants a gold border around his mirror.

00:00:29.652 --> 00:00:33.247
A border isn't one plain rectangle.

00:00:33.297 --> 00:00:36.278
That's Area of Composite Figures.

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:37.710
See you in the workshop.
